<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>en</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>CARGA</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<!-- opengym:// links: a widget tap opens the screen it is about (lib/widget-links.js), and opengym.ch/nfc hands a read sticker to the app as opengym://nfc?... (NfcTagsPlugin), and opengym.ch/r a friend's routine as opengym://r#... (RoutineShare.jsx). -->
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>app.carga.treino.widgets</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>opengym</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UILaunchStoryboardName</key>
	<string>LaunchScreen</string>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
		<key>UISceneConfigurations</key>
		<dict>
			<key>UIWindowSceneSessionRoleApplication</key>
			<array>
				<dict>
					<key>UISceneConfigurationName</key>
					<string>Default Configuration</string>
					<key>UISceneDelegateClassName</key>
					<string>$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).SceneDelegate</string>
					<key>UISceneStoryboardFile</key>
					<string>Main</string>
				</dict>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>arm64</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
	<true/>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<!-- "Connect to my server" and the Coach's own endpoint may be plain http:// on the
		     home network (#428), like on Android. Local addresses only; everything on the
		     internet stays HTTPS. -->
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para falar com um servidor ou modelo de IA na sua rede de casa, quando você conecta um.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para ler o QR code da sua academia, tirar foto ou gravar vídeo de um exercício que você cria e filmar uma série para conferir a sua execução.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para gravar o som do vídeo de um exercício que você cria ou de uma série que você filma.</string>
	<key>BAAppGroupID</key>
	<string>group.app.carga.treino</string>
	<key>BAHasManagedAssetPacks</key>
	<true/>
	<key>BAUsesAppleHosting</key>
	<true/>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>app.carga.treino.nudge-check</string>
	</array>
	<!-- processing: as in Apple's iPhone workout sample ("Building a workout app for iPhone and
	     iPad", WWDC25 322) for the iPhone's own workout session (#818, AirPods heart rate, iOS 26).
	     Not watchOS's workout-processing, which Apple lists for the watch only. -->
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>fetch</string>
		<string>processing</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para mostrar os seus batimentos durante o treino, medidos pelo Apple Watch ou por AirPods que medem, e, quando você liga essa opção, trazer os batimentos que o relógio salvou e as pesagens de outros apps.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para salvar no app Saúde os treinos terminados (com os batimentos medidos neles) e as pesagens, quando você liga essa opção.</string>
	<!-- Gym reminder (#614): off until switched on in Settings. Region monitoring needs Always,
	     but no background location mode (UIBackgroundModes stays without "location"). -->
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para marcar no mapa a academia onde você está, para o lembrete de treino. A sua localização fica só neste iPhone.</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Permite que o lembrete de treino perceba quando você chega a uma academia que você cadastrou, mesmo com o CARGA fechado. O iPhone só observa esses lugares, e a sua localização nunca sai dele.</string>
	<!-- NFC stickers (NfcTagsPlugin.swift): Core NFC's own sheet, only when you write one. -->
	<key>NFCReaderUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para gravar links do CARGA nos seus adesivos NFC, para que um toque comece o treino ou abra um exercício.</string>
	<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Usado para confirmar que é você antes de apagar a sua conta.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
